 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Structure of the infinitive clause with complements",
     "texto": [
      "When an infinitive dependent on verbs like **beabsichtigen, versuchen, planen, hoffen, versprechen** or expressions like **bereit sein, die Absicht haben** has its own complements (objects, adverbs), these are placed in the middle:",
      "- **Die Firma beabsichtigt, [eine langfristige Partnerschaft mit dem Partner] einzugehen**.",
      "- Specialised connectors: **um ... zu** (purpose), **ohne ... zu** (privative manner), **anstatt ... zu** (substitution).",
      "Comma rule: in modern German the comma is strongly recommended and is **strictly obligatory** when the construction is introduced by **um, ohne, anstatt**, when it depends on a correlative pronoun (**es**), or when it prevents syntactic misunderstandings."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Type of construction",
